nutes limits and rest days are expected after his return, so 31 for the season instead of 34.","sources":["https://youtu.be/-DN4P92Wp8Y?t=1818"]},{"field":"usg","text":"Once healthy he is the number one option next to Garland, and his usage could rise toward 30%. I set 28% because Garland takes the main ball-handling share.","sources":["https://youtu.be/sTtFUy7IoJI?t=889","https://youtu.be/ahNxsoU8Hx4?t=797"]},{"field":"fg_pct","text":"Players usually lose some efficiency after an Achilles tear, mostly on two-point finishing. FG% 0.98 on about 16 FGA.","sources":["stats"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"A slow healer on a team with nothing to play for: a few protective rest days late.","sources":["https://youtu.be/tnzmsYUA4yQ?t=165"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}